WEBVTT
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.190
Hana opens her lesson on a phone in Addis Ababa.

2
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:11.702
She needs English and Amharic captions she can make larger.

3
00:00:11.702 --> 00:00:22.036
A sign window can move and grow, so Ethiopian Sign Language sits where she needs it.

4
00:00:22.036 --> 00:00:28.919
Audio description says what the picture is doing, for a learner who cannot see it.

5
00:00:28.919 --> 00:00:36.761
When the network is slow she keeps a small pack: sound, text, and a light page.

6
00:00:36.761 --> 00:00:43.179
The lesson on this page is the same one, with the network or without it.
